<title>ITALY: Pirelli launches offer for Pirelli Tyre NV.</title>
<headline>Pirelli launches offer for Pirelli Tyre NV.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian tyre and cable maker Pirelli SpA announced a public offer for all the outstanding shares and warrants it does not already own in Pirelli Tyre Holding NV listed on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Pirelli SpA already holds 93.6 percent of the outstanding shares and 93.7 percent of the outstanding warrants of Pirelli Tyre Holding NV.</p>
<p>Pirelli SpA is expect to offer an amount of 19.50 guilders per share and 0.50 guilders per warrant in cash, a Pirelli statement said.</p>
</text>
